{"name": "Kamikaze Tactics", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045260/extras/c7f975018ff5610012cbf40d853b0d77.poster.avif?t=1761336475\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045260/extras/c7f975018ff5610012cbf40d853b0d77.webm?t=1761336475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045260/extras/c7f975018ff5610012cbf40d853b0d77.mp4?t=1761336475\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Background</strong></h2> Life in exile was empty until founding The Spare Talons. Now there's not a day without a job. Join the Captain in his quest for revenge as he recruits his crew, outfits their ships, and takes down a rotten regime while collecting a paycheck.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2>In Kamikaze Tactics you will:<br/><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045260/extras/97265fb64fc13999f81855bd20c3182f.poster.avif?t=1761336475\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045260/extras/97265fb64fc13999f81855bd20c3182f.webm?t=1761336475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045260/extras/97265fb64fc13999f81855bd20c3182f.mp4?t=1761336475\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Devise unique strategies to outmaneuver your opponents.</h2>Compose your squadron from a variety of pilots and units, all with unique abilities, strengths, and weaknesses.<br/>Once in battle, plan your movements while thinking turns ahead to maintain a positional advantage and outflank your enemies.<br/><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045260/extras/059390250b7f804f447f1e9d89ac2e5b.poster.avif?t=1761336475\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045260/extras/059390250b7f804f447f1e9d89ac2e5b.webm?t=1761336475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045260/extras/059390250b7f804f447f1e9d89ac2e5b.mp4?t=1761336475\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Shields beat missiles. Armor beats kinetics. Energy weapons split the difference.</h2>Combat doesn't end with good positioning. Your weaponry matters too.<br/>With a variety of weapons systems at your disposal, you will find yourself making decisions to apply the best tools to the job.<br/><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045260/extras/4d6986552ab821a19db13a42295ceebc.poster.avif?t=1761336475\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045260/extras/4d6986552ab821a19db13a42295ceebc.webm?t=1761336475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045260/extras/4d6986552ab821a19db13a42295ceebc.mp4?t=1761336475\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The world fights back.</h2>Arenas come with modifiers from artillery fire to signal jamming which will force you to alter your gameplay and test your mastery.<br/><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045260/extras/69a22ccc5887a4977b3660b4296bf542.poster.avif?t=1761336475\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045260/extras/69a22ccc5887a4977b3660b4296bf542.webm?t=1761336475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Each run is unique.</h2>You will meet different crew members, fight different bosses, and discover more character interactions with every playthrough.\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>", "short_desc": "Soar into the skies in this turn-based tactics roguelike where every dogfight is a test of skill. Recruit your crew, upgrade your ships, and outmaneuver your foes to seize victory in this high-stakes tale of revenge!", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045260/header.jpg?t=1761336475", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Strategy", "Tactical RPG", "Turn-Based Tactics", "Roguelite", "Perma Death", "Flight"], "developers": "sudo make", "publishers": "sudo make", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3045260", "review_type": "Not Recommended", "curator_desc": "1 February 2025 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/Urj9qPYVwAQ", "first_seen": 1738364400.0, "review_rank": 1943}